WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.778 --> 00:00:15.408
"What happened here?"

2
00:00:15.709 --> 00:00:16.909
Wukong asked the gibbon.

3
00:00:17.990 --> 00:00:21.513
A few more monkeys and apes gathered around Sun Wukong and the gibbon.

4
00:00:22.494 --> 00:00:23.395
They looked scared.

5
00:00:23.415 --> 00:00:26.257
"A demon attacked us," said the gibbon.

6
00:00:26.277 --> 00:00:29.520
"We tried to fight him, but he was too powerful.

7
00:00:30.560 --> 00:00:33.222
He stole most of our things and kidnapped many of us."

8
00:00:34.923 --> 00:00:35.944
was furious.

9
00:00:36.744 --> 00:00:37.205
"Who is he?

10
00:00:37.485 --> 00:00:38.125
Where does he live?"

11
00:00:39.226 --> 00:00:41.748
"He is called the Demon of Chaos," said the gibbon.

12
00:00:41.768 --> 00:00:43.749
"He came from the north."

13
00:00:45.690 --> 00:00:47.351
"Wait here," Wukong ordered.

14
00:00:47.371 --> 00:00:49.313
"I will handle the demon."

15
00:00:49.573 --> 00:00:52.875
"The demon is very powerful," the gibbon warned.

16
00:00:53.876 --> 00:00:56.898
"I learned many things from a sage," Wukong replied.

17
00:00:58.139 --> 00:00:59.880
am now as powerful as a god!

18
00:01:00.924 --> 00:01:02.505
I'm not afraid of any demon.

19
00:01:03.485 --> 00:01:04.206
I'll be back soon."

20
00:01:05.806 --> 00:01:08.147
He leaped into the air and flew north.

21
00:01:10.769 --> 00:01:12.770
His subjects stared in amazement.

22
00:01:12.790 --> 00:01:14.670
"Our king can fly!"

23
00:01:15.011 --> 00:01:15.591
said the gibbon.

24
00:01:18.372 --> 00:01:20.193
soon spotted a gloomy mountain.

25
00:01:21.173 --> 00:01:22.914
Dark clouds hung over it.

26
00:01:24.295 --> 00:01:26.476
"That looks like a demon's home," he thought.

27
00:01:29.420 --> 00:01:31.961
Wukong landed on the mountain and found a cave.

28
00:01:33.022 --> 00:01:36.524
Two guards stood at the entrance, practicing sword fighting.

29
00:01:36.544 --> 00:01:40.246
"I'm king of the Fruit and Flower Mountain!"

30
00:01:40.546 --> 00:01:41.347
yelled Wukong.

31
00:01:42.487 --> 00:01:44.508
Demon of Chaos attacked my subjects!

32
00:01:45.389 --> 00:01:46.289
I want revenge!"

33
00:01:50.972 --> 00:01:53.493
the guards shrieked, and ran into the cave.

34
00:01:55.174 --> 00:01:58.136
The Demon of Chaos was sitting at a table, eating a meal.

35
00:01:59.200 --> 00:02:01.161
"Disaster!" one guard cried.

36
00:02:01.181 --> 00:02:04.021
"What sort of disaster?"

37
00:02:04.462 --> 00:02:05.282
asked the demon.

38
00:02:05.302 --> 00:02:09.183
"There's a monkey outside," said the other guard.

39
00:02:09.203 --> 00:02:12.484
"He said he's king of the Fruit and Flower Mountain.

40
00:02:13.564 --> 00:02:14.804
attacked his subjects.

41
00:02:15.725 --> 00:02:17.205
Now he wants revenge!"

42
00:02:18.926 --> 00:02:22.547
"The monkeys and apes have spoken of a king," said the demon.

43
00:02:23.747 --> 00:02:25.247
left to find a sage.

44
00:02:25.588 --> 00:02:28.168
I guess he returned."

45
00:02:28.388 --> 00:02:29.189
demon stood up.

46
00:02:29.209 --> 00:02:31.890
"Does the monkey have any weapons?"

47
00:02:33.371 --> 00:02:34.852
"No," said one guard.

48
00:02:34.872 --> 00:02:39.554
"Then get me my armor and my sword," said the demon.

49
00:02:41.455 --> 00:02:44.597
A moment later the Demon of Chaos walked outside.

50
00:02:49.139 --> 00:02:50.800
looked at Wukong and laughed.

51
00:02:50.820 --> 00:02:53.362
"You're just a little monkey!"

52
00:02:53.682 --> 00:02:54.102
he said.

53
00:02:55.063 --> 00:02:57.204
Wukong looked up at the huge demon.

54
00:02:58.328 --> 00:03:02.889
"I am small," he said, "but I am more powerful than you can imagine."

55
00:03:05.570 --> 00:03:06.670
not afraid of you!"

56
00:03:07.050 --> 00:03:07.751
said the demon.

57
00:03:08.571 --> 00:03:10.731
He swung his sword.

58
00:03:10.791 --> 00:03:13.732
Wukong jumped out of the way and then flew at the demon.

59
00:03:15.913 --> 00:03:17.853
Wukong hit the demon on the nose.

60
00:03:17.873 --> 00:03:21.274
"Argh!" cried the demon.

61
00:03:22.355 --> 00:03:25.455
Wukong pulled out a handful of his own hair and blew on it.

62
00:03:28.852 --> 00:03:33.617
Each strand of hair turned into a fake monkey—exactly like Wukong.

63
00:03:35.118 --> 00:03:39.101
All at once the fake monkeys attacked the demon, punching and kicking him.

64
00:03:41.063 --> 00:03:42.304
What's going on?"

65
00:03:42.504 --> 00:03:45.627
cried the demon, trying to fight all the fake monkeys.

66
00:03:47.489 --> 00:03:49.390
a magic spell," said Wukong.

67
00:03:49.410 --> 00:03:52.153
"It's called Body Beyond the Body."

68
00:03:53.174 --> 00:03:55.476
The Demon of Chaos was soon destroyed.

69
00:03:58.912 --> 00:04:01.835
Wukong chased away the guards and then went into the cave.

70
00:04:05.438 --> 00:04:08.401
He found all the monkeys and apes that the demon had kidnapped.

71
00:04:09.302 --> 00:04:11.083
When they saw him, they cheered.

72
00:04:13.646 --> 00:04:16.348
Majesty!" cried the monkeys and apes.

73
00:04:16.368 --> 00:04:18.250
"You came back!"

74
00:04:19.631 --> 00:04:20.752
Wukong smiled.

75
00:04:20.772 --> 00:04:22.574
"I will take you home!"

76
00:04:26.752 --> 00:04:29.213
The next morning Wukong woke up early.

77
00:04:29.233 --> 00:04:33.735
"Other demons might attack us," he thought.

78
00:04:33.755 --> 00:04:36.876
"We must be ready to protect ourselves."

79
00:04:39.537 --> 00:04:43.059
Wukong spent the day teaching his subjects how to fight.

80
00:04:44.099 --> 00:04:46.260
They practiced with swords and spears.

81
00:04:47.561 --> 00:04:50.922
Before long, the monkeys and apes were a fierce army.

82
00:04:50.942 --> 00:04:55.464
"No demon will dare bother us now," said the gibbon.

83
00:04:56.636 --> 00:04:57.957
"No," said Wukong.

84
00:04:57.977 --> 00:05:00.419
"There's just one problem though."

85
00:05:00.439 --> 00:05:01.940
"What's that?"

86
00:05:02.300 --> 00:05:02.960
asked the gibbon.

87
00:05:02.980 --> 00:05:07.643
"I can't use any of the weapons we have!"
